eet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/95.html\">Sûre At-Tin</a> › Âyet 5</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre At-Tin 95:5</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿ثُمَّ رَدَدْنَاهُ أَسْفَلَ سَافِلِينَ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Daha sonra, onu aşağıların en aşağısına döndürdük.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وفي قوله {أسفل سافلين} قولان. قيل: الهرم. وقيل: العذاب بعد الموت وهذا هو الذي دلت عليه الآية قطعا.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/279</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s95a5\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/95-1.html\">Önceki âyet (95:1)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/95-6.html\">Sonraki âyet (95:6)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/95-6.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: At-Tin 95:6 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Ancak iman edip salih ameller işleyenler ayrı. Onlar için kesintisiz bir ecir vardır.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/95-6.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tefsiri: At-Tin 95:6 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Ancak iman edip salih ameller işleyenler ayrı. Onlar için kesintisiz bir ecir vardır.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Ana sayfa\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sûre At-Tin\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/95.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Âyet 6\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/95-6.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> › <a href=\"/tr/surah/95.html\">Sûre At-Tin</a> › Âyet 6</nav><h1>Tefsiri: Sûre At-Tin 95:6</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِلَّا الَّذِينَ آمَنُوا وَعَمِلُوا الصَّالِحَاتِ فَلَهُمْ أَجْرٌ غَيْرُ مَمْنُونٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Meal</h3><p class=\"tr\">Ancak iman edip salih ameller işleyenler ayrı. Onlar için kesintisiz bir ecir vardır.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Turkish Translation - Rowwad Translation Center — v1.0.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">İki imamın sözleri, kaynaklarıyla birlikte, aslı olan Arapça metinle aynen verilmiştir.</p><section><h2>Şeyhülislam İbn Teymiyye</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فإنه جعله في أسفل سافلين إلا المؤمنين. والناس نوعان: فالكافر بعد الموت يعذب في أسفل سافلين والمؤمن في عليين.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/279</cite></blockquote><h3>Başkalarından naklettikleri</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">إبراهيم النخعي</span> <span class=\"st\">رجّح غيره</span> «إذا بلغ المؤمن من الكبر ما يعجز عن العمل كتب الله له ما كان يعمل وهو قوله {فلهم أجر غير ممنون}»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/280</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن قتيبة</span> <span class=\"st\">رجّح غيره</span> «المعنى {إلا الذين آمنوا} في وقت القوة والقدرة فإنهم في حال الكبر غير منقوصين وإن عجزوا عن الطاعات. فإن الله يعلم لو لم يسلبهم القوة لم ينقطعوا عن أفعال الخير فهو يجري لهم أجر ذلك.»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 16/280</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=tr#s95a6\">Etkileşimli tefsirde aç (tam metinler)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/tr/ayah/95-5.html\">Önceki âyet (95:5)</a><a href=\"/tr/ayah/95-7.html\">Sonraki âyet (95:7)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tefsîru&#x27;ş-Şeyhayn · <a href=\"/tr/\">Ana sayfa</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Proje hakkında</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Gizlilik ve şartlar</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/95-7.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"tr\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tefsiri: At-Tin 95:7 — İbn Teymiyye ve İbnü&#x27;l-Kayyim&#x27;e göre</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"(Ey insan!) Böyle iken, hangi şey sana hesap ve cezayı yalanlatıyor?\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/95-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/95-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/95-7.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/9